    "type": "agent",
    "id": "jordan-agent",
    "name": "Jordan"
   }
  ],
  "text": "Hey Jordan — I'm having a few people over at my place this Saturday around 3:30. Nothing formal, just coffee and something to eat. Would be great if you came. Let me know?",
